    "title": "Pollmiller's Halloween Hoot canceled - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Heather Huebner, Lee County Conservation Director ,\n7 hours ago WEST POINT - Lee County Conservation has made the difficult decision to cancel the annual Halloween HOOT, which was scheduled for Saturday, October 3, 2026, at Pollmiller Park. The cancellation is due to the ongoing construction of the new Pollmiller Beach Concession & Bathroom Facility, combined with limited staff capacity... Read full article",
